    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baraskii Nacamaan Ee La Bogsiiyey",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Nacamaan oo ahaa sirkaalkii ciidanka boqorka Suuriya wuxuu ahaa nin xagga sayidkiisa ku weyn oo ciso leh, maxaa yeelay, isaga ayaa Rabbigu reer Suuriya lib ku siiyey; oo weliba wuxuu ahaa nin xoog leh, laakiinse baras buu qabay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Suuriyana guutooyin bay ku baxeen, oo waxay dalkii Israa'iil ka soo dhaceen gabadh yar, oo iyana Nacamaan bilcantiisa ayay u adeegi jirtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay sayidaddeedii ku tidhi, Hoogay, haddii sayidkaygu hor tegi lahaa nebiga Samaariya jooga wuu ka bogsiin lahaa baraskan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mid baa sayidkiisii u galay oo ku yidhi, Gabadhii dalka Israa'iil ka timid saas iyo saas bay tidhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Suuriya wuxuu Nacamaan ku yidhi, War orod oo tag, oo anna warqad baan kuugu sii dhiibayaa boqorka dalka Israa'iil. Oo isna wuu tegey, oo wuxuu qaaday toban talanti oo lacag ah, iyo lix kun oo sheqel oo dahab ah, iyo toban iskujoog oo dhar ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu u keenay boqorkii dalka Israa'iil warqaddii lahayd, Haddaba markii warqaddanu kuu timaado, bal eeg, addoonkayga Nacamaan ah ayaan kugu soo diray si aad baraska uga bogsiisid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii boqorkii dalka Israa'iil warqaddii akhriyey ayuu dharkiisii iska jeexjeexay oo wuxuu yidhi, War ma anigaa ah Ilaah wax dili kara, waxna noolayn kara? Oo ninkanu ma saasuu nin iigu soo diray si aan baraska uga bogsiiyo? Waan idin baryayaaye bal u fiirsada siduu ii daandaansanayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii Eliishaa oo ahaa nin Ilaah uu maqlay in boqorkii dalka Israa'iil dharkiisii iska jeexjeexay ayuu u cid diray boqorkii oo ku yidhi, War maxaad dharkaagii isaga jeexjeexday? Bal isagu ha ii yimaado, oo wuxuu ogaan doonaa in dalka Israa'iil nebi dhex joogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Nacamaan yimid, isagoo wata fardihiisii iyo gaadhifardoodkiisii, oo wuxuu soo hor istaagay albaabkii gurigii Eliishaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Eliishaa wargeeyuu u diray oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Tag oo Webi Urdun toddoba jeer ku maydho, oo jiidhkaagu mar kaluu kuu soo noqon doonaa, oo nadiif baad ahaan doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Nacamaan wuu cadhooday oo tegey, oo wuxuu yidhi, Bal eega, waxaan mooday inuu isaga qudhiisu ii soo baxayo oo istaagayo, oo uu magaca Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ah iigu ducaynayo, oo uu gacantiisa meesha bukta dul marmarinayo, oo uu saas baraska ku bogsiinayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War Abaanaah iyo Farfar oo ah webiyadii Dimishaq sow kama wanaagsana biyaha dalka Israa'iil oo dhan? Bal miyaanan iyaga ku maydhan karin oo nadiif ahaan karin? Sidaas daraaddeed wuu noqday, oo wuxuu tegey isagoo cadhaysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse addoommadiisii ayaa u yimid oo la hadlay, oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Aabbow, haddii nebigu wax weyn kugu amro sow ma aadan samayseen? Haddaba bal maxaa ka sahlan hadduu kugu yidhaahdo, Maydho, oo nadiif noqo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu tegey, oo sidii ninkii Ilaah isaga ku yidhi ayuu yeelay, oo Webi Urdun ayuu toddoba jeer liimbaday; oo jiidhkiisiina mar kaluu u soo noqday isagoo u eg ilmo yar jiidhkiis, nadiif buuna noqday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ninkii Ilaah ku noqday, oo isagii iyo kooxdiisii oo dhammuba, intay yimaadeen ayay hortiisii soo istaageen; oo isna wuxuu yidhi, Bal eeg, haatan waan ogahay inaan dunida oo dhan Ilaah lagu arag dalka Israa'iil mooyaane, haddaba sidaas daraaddeed waxaan kaa baryayaa inaad qaadato hadiyaddayda anoo addoonkaaga ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Eliishaa wuxuu yidhi, Waxaan ku dhaartay nolosha Rabbiga aan hor taagnahaye inaanan waxba kaa qaadanayn. Oo isna wuu ku sii cadaadiyey inuu qaato, laakiinse Eliishaa wuu diiday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Nacamaan wuxuu yidhi, Haddii ayan saas ahayn weliba waxaan kaa baryayaa in anigoo addoonkaaga ah lay siiyo ciid intii ay laba baqal qaadi karaan, waayo, anigoo addoonkaaga ah, hadda ka dib Rabbiga mooyaane ilaahyo kale u bixin maayo qurbaan la gubo iyo allabari toona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxakanna Rabbigu ha iga cafiyo anigoo addoonkaaga ah, markii sayidkaygu guriga Rimmon u tago inuu ku tukado, oo uu ku tiirsada gacantayda ee aan anna ku sujuudo guriga Rimmon gudihiisa, oo markaan ku sujuudo guriga Rimmon gudihiisa Rabbigu anigoo addoonkaaga ah ha iga cafiyo waxakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu isagii ku yidhi, Orod oo nabad ku tag. Sidaas daraaddeed in yar buu ka socday.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Geexasii oo ahaa midiidinkii Eliishaa oo ahaa ninkii Ilaah wuxuu yidhi, Bal eega, sayidkaygu wuu u tudhay Nacamaan kii reer Suuriya, oo wixii uu u keenayna waxba kama uu qaadan. Waxaan Rabbiga noloshiisa ugu dhaartay inaan intaan isagii ka daba ordo wax ka soo qaato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Geexasii wuxuu daba galay Nacamaan. Oo Nacamaanna markuu arkay mid soo daba ordaya ayuu gaadhifaraskiisii ka soo degtay inuu ka hor tago, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, War ma nabad baa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Waa nabad. Oo sayidkaygii baa i soo diray oo wuxuu kugu soo yidhi, Haddeerba waxaa ii yimid laba nin oo dhallinyar oo qoonkii nebiyada ah oo ka yimid dalka buuraha leh oo reer Efrayim; haddaba waxaan kaa baryayaa inaad iyaga siiso talanti lacag ah iyo laba iskujoog oo dhar ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Nacamaan yidhi, Oggolow oo qaad laba talanti oo lacag ah. Wuuna ku sii adkeeyey, oo labadii talanti wuxuu ugu xidhay laba kiish, oo wuxuu ugu sii daray laba iskujoog oo dhar ah, oo weliba wuxuu u saaray laba midiidinnadiisii ah, oo iyana intay u qaadeen ayay hortiisa socdeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu buurtii yimid ayuu gacmahoodii ka qaaday, oo guriguu dhigtay; nimankiina wuu iska diray oo way tageen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagiina intuu gudaha galay ayuu sayidkiisii hor istaagay. Markaasaa Eliishaa ku yidhi, Geexasiiyow, xaggee baad ka timid? Isna wuxuu yidhi, Anigoo addoonkaaga ahu meella ma tegin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu isagii ku yidhi, War sow qalbigaygu kulama socon markii ninku gaadhifaraskiisii ka soo noqday inuu kaa hor yimaado? War haatan ma wakhti lacag la qaataa oo ma wakhti la qaataa dhar, iyo beero saytuun ah, iyo beero canab ah, iyo ido, iyo dibi, iyo niman addoommo ah, iyo naago addoommo ah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waxaa adiga iyo farcankaagaba idinku dhegi doona weligiin Nacamaan baraskiisii. Oo wuxuu hortiisii ka tegey isagoo baras qaba oo u cad sida baraf cad oo kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
